==============================================

- Validate the selected span before converting it to the existing `int` insertion-length contract, preventing `span + 1` wraparound in `clear-selection`. Protect the wide-character replacement allocation before multiplying by `sizeof(wchar_t)`.
- Preserve normal selection replacement, callbacks, cursor behavior, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the bounds contract in `docs/textfield-clear-selection-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled TextField source build; the former `ClearSelection` out-of-bounds warning is absent.

Text selection-array allocation bounds (2026-10-24)
===================================================

- Check the configurable Text selection-array element count before multiplying by `sizeof(XmTextScanType)`. Invalid counts now fall back to Motif's built-in scan table instead of wrapping the allocation size.
- Preserve scan-type traversal, resource/API contracts, widget ownership and native ABI. Document the fallback in `docs/text-selection-array-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled TextIn source build.

Text key-selection parameter initialization (2026-10-24)
==========================================================

- Initialize `key-select` cursor and range values before action-parameter conversion, so unknown direction names become a harmless no-op instead of reaching selection scanning with uninitialized state.
- Preserve valid horizontal/vertical action behavior, selection resources, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Add `tests/automated/check-text-key-selection.c` and document the behavior in `docs/text-key-selection-parameters.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the invalid-parameter regression under Xvfb.

DataField insert-string action bounds (2026-10-24)
==================================================

- Replace the unbounded `strcpy` in the `insert-string` action with a complete parameter-length check before copying into the fixed 64-byte action buffer. Oversized action parameters are ignored safely.
- Preserve normal action filtering, locale conversion, replacement, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Add `tests/automated/check-datafield-insert-action.c` and document the contract in `docs/datafield-insert-action-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the oversized-parameter regression under Xvfb.

DataField picture verification cleanup (2026-10-24)
====================================================

- Release the temporary current-value string on all picture verification exits. Rejected edits now also release the splice buffer and picture state before returning, preventing repeated picture edits from leaking conversion state.
- Preserve picture validation callbacks, autofill behavior, accepted/rejected edit semantics, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the lifetime contract in `docs/datafield-picture-verify-lifetime.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField action regression.

DataField destination ownership guard (2026-10-24)
==================================================

- Restrict `XtDisownSelection` and display-wide destination clearing to the branch where the DataField actually owns the destination selection. This prevents an unrelated owner from being disowned.
- Preserve destination acquisition/release behavior, callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the ownership rule in `docs/datafield-destination-selection.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField action regression.

DataField paste conversion cleanup (2026-10-24)
================================================

- Release the temporary `XmbTextPropertyToTextList` string list in the wide-character paste path. Detect `mbstowcs` failure before adding its result to the destination offset, rejecting malformed locale input safely.
- Preserve single-byte and wide-character paste behavior, replacement callbacks, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the cleanup contract in `docs/datafield-paste-conversion.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField regression.

DataField selection export conversion bounds (2026-10-24)
==========================================================

- Treat zero or negative `mblen` results as conversion failure while exporting multibyte DataField selections, preventing infinite loops and unsigned length underflow on malformed locale sequences.
- Preserve valid selection text, ownership, public interfaces and native ABI. Extend `check-datafield-wcs` with valid UTF-8 selection export coverage and document the behavior in `docs/datafield-selection-export.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the rebuilt DataField source and six-check DataField wide/selection regression.

DataField picture splice buffer bounds (2026-10-24)
====================================================

- Size the picture-verification splice buffer in bytes using the actual character lengths instead of pointer-size multiplication. Reject malformed negative lengths and detect size addition overflow before allocation.
- Preserve accepted/rejected picture edits, callbacks, autofill behavior, public interfaces and native ABI. Document the allocation contract in `docs/datafield-picture-buffer-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the warning-enabled DataField build and Xvfb DataField regression.

DataField wide selection export bounds (2026-10-24)
=====================================================

- Check `XmDataFieldGetSelectionWcs` selection lengths before multiplying by `sizeof(wchar_t)`, returning cleanly when the allocation cannot be represented.
- Preserve valid wide selection contents, termination, application-lock behavior, public interfaces and native ABI. Extend the DataField wide-text regression to cover WCS selection export and document the contract in `docs/datafield-selection-wcs-bounds.md`.
- Native AArch64 validation passes the rebuilt DataField source and seven-check wide selection regression.

TextField selection export bounds (2026-10-24)
